{
  "title": "Stripe: Cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Saved Cards and Disputes | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Stripe takes card payments, adds Apple Pay and Google Pay, remembers cards for signed in buyers, and tells your store about disputes. This video shows how to enter your test keys, what Connect and Disconnect do, what buyers see at checkout and under My account, and how Disputed and Risky payments appear. The demo never contacts Stripe.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why Stripe, and how keys, Connect and the webhook fit together\n• Entering your test keys and the Connect button\n• What Connect does: the webhook, wallets and Disconnect\n• Apple Pay, Google Pay and saved cards\n• Disputes and risky payments",
